    "summary": "As your Shooting phase begins, you may have one of your army’s PSYKER models cast Death Hex. Pick an enemy unit the caster can see within 12″, then roll one D6. A 1 deals D3 mortal wounds to the caster’s unit. On 2+, attacks against the chosen enemy improve their Armour Penetration by 1 until your next Movement phase begins.",
